{"title": "Construction starts on Sydney’s first purpose-built electric bus depot", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/05/19/construction-starts-on-sydneys-first-purpose-built-electric-bus-depot/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/19/construction-starts-on-sydneys-first-purpose-built-electric-bus-depot/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Construction starts on Sydney’s first purpose-built electric bus depot\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/ZEB-251002-Macquarie-Park-Depot-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Construction has officially begun on Sydney’s first purpose-built electric bus depot, which will be capable of charging 150 battery electric buses.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/19/construction-starts-on-sydneys-first-purpose-built-electric-bus-depot/\">Construction starts on Sydney’s first purpose-built electric bus depot</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-05-19T00:23:02+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-05-19T13:27:53.680334+00:00"}
{"title": "Sydney Harbour expected to have its first electric ferry within two years", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/05/19/sydney-harbour-expected-to-have-its-first-electric-ferry-within-two-years/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/19/sydney-harbour-expected-to-have-its-first-electric-ferry-within-two-years/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Sydney Harbour expected to have its first electric ferry within two years\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Parramatta-River-Class-ferry-Transport-for-NSW-FB-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Sydney Harbour is expected to have its first electric ferry within two years - beginning a trial that will decide whether more electric ferries will join the fleet. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/19/sydney-harbour-expected-to-have-its-first-electric-ferry-within-two-years/\">Sydney Harbour expected to have its first electric ferry within two years</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-05-19T00:19:26+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-05-19T13:27:53.680334+00:00"}
