{"title": "Network giant trials its first electric prime mover and heavy duty charger with battery", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/05/18/network-giant-trials-its-first-electric-prime-mover-and-heavy-duty-charger-with-battery/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/18/network-giant-trials-its-first-electric-prime-mover-and-heavy-duty-charger-with-battery/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Network giant trials its first electric prime mover and heavy duty charger with battery\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Photo-May-15-2026-11-39-16-AM-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Network giant's first electric prime mover will ply a route between the Hunter Valley and southern Sydney, with a local start-up coming up with a charging solution that includes battery storage.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/18/network-giant-trials-its-first-electric-prime-mover-and-heavy-duty-charger-with-battery/\">Network giant trials its first electric prime mover and heavy duty charger with battery</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-05-18T02:49:16+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-05-19T13:27:53.680334+00:00"}
